flowchart TD
    U[User] --> I[Internet]
    I --> IGW[Internet Gateway]
    IGW --> SG[Security Group]
    SG --> EC2[EC2 Ubuntu Instance]

    EC2 --> N[Nginx Reverse Proxy]
    N --> F[Flask Application]

    F --> S3[Private S3 Bucket]
    F --> SSM[SSM Parameter Store]
    SSM -. Secure Parameter .-> F

    IAM[IAM Role] -. Attached to .-> EC2

    EC2 --> CW[CloudWatch]
    N --> LOG[Nginx Access and Error Logs]
    F --> J[Systemd Journal Logs]
    LOG --> CW
    J --> CW

    DDB[DynamoDB Messages Table]
    NOTE[Explored AWS Resource] -.-> DDB
